    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4011" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλεξί-κᾰκος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>keeping off ill</i> or
				<i>mischief</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῆτις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					10.20
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				123
			</span></i> (as v.l.), <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				1043
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				8.41.8
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥάμνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Euph.
					137
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἀ. τῆς ἐπιστήμης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hierocl.
					<u>in CA</u>
					12p.447M.
				</span></i>
			: c.gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίψης ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					6.170
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Thyill.
			</span></i>): epith. of Heracles, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
			</span></i><i>Alex..</i><i><span class="en">
				4
			</span></i>, etc.; of Hermes, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pax</u>
				422
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὦλεξίκακε</span>”
				<i>save the mark!</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Nu.</u>
					1372
				</span></i>
			; of Zeus, <i>Tab.Defix. Aud.</i><i><span class="en">
				26.2
			</span></i> (Crete, <span class="entity">iv/iii B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.1076b
			</span></i>.</div>
